  <item>
    <title>35 - 恋爱吵架 出差偷闲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d4814fe2c8be31558bfbdf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d4814fe2c8be31558bfbdf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 04:08:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025下半年宝剑和74又都去了哪儿，和伴侣吵了哪些架，看了哪些剧，这期集中和大家分享一下。宝剑对象最特别的过生日方式是什么，74怎么就那么想加入。国外自驾游怎么能最大满足自己的中国胃？牛马们下班都爱看什么剧？划到最下面有配图哦，欢迎大家来和我们讨论！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 宝剑对象过生日薅羊毛引发的吵架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 74在墨尔本街头接到对象的电话吵架（封面图面就在案发地附近）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 74和旅游搭子的穷游秘诀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1457">24:17</a> 宝剑出差总结出来的运动小妙招</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> 干净这件事，早上还是晚上洗澡，出过门的裤子能不能坐沙发？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a> 有对象在家对于居家办公是个好事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a> 打工人下班看点啥，不同国家的恋爱真人秀有什么区别</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>小妙招：可以问Chatgpt哪个国家版本的哪一季好看</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">46:09</a> 之前就被宝剑种草，才发现F1这片新大陆</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>提到的：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>恋爱真人秀：恋爱岛Love Island</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影：F1：狂暴飞车 F1: The Movie</span></p><span></span><p><span>网飞纪录片：一级方程式：极速争胜 Formula 1 Drive to Survive</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅游推荐：澳洲袋鼠岛</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>每片海都能让人看很久</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnZEbVW7KXD1pbFDhXYl9uKEccvM.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>海滩上熟睡着的海狮宝宝们</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAAf-KDsXJAc49eZzgBq_Ctc3M0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>旅游推荐：美国马里兰州弗雷德里克市 Frederick, Maryland</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>学校改建的很特别的酒店Visitation Hotel</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmw4jXJLr58Dr5464AdD8J7ZdzHi.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv09Bwlzjm2WbvusORJyngvYXtWz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
