    <guid isPermaLink="false">689014a88e06fe8de7283c45</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Aug 2025 02:08:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Boo! 大家好 沉默了大半年的我们回来了！给大家讲讲我们闭麦的这几个月发生了什么 74和宝剑有什么新的改变。感谢你们的耐心我们一直在💖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">00:03:20</a> 74找工update</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">00:07:40</a> UI/UX designer 怎么面试: 面试也是要练习的 / portfolio准备/ 线上 vs 线下面试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">00:10:40</a> 宝剑的面试: wfh vs 回办公室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">00:16:10</a> 找工作心态的转变: deepseek玄学加持 / 和recruitor合作的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">00:24:38</a> 僵尸工作？现在的 job market怎么样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">00:35:37</a> 无业之后父母家人的反应: emo期总会过去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">00:39:12</a> 年初订的目标还在坚持吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>P.s. 大伙能听出来74斥巨资换的新麦克风和之前有什么区别嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span>P.s.s 2025下半年我们会恢复（不定期）更新的！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65ed1bdd2d96b6aa80c620be/lq-Z8oOStzHrobK8SRdDqOXLWQJq.m4a" length="44883631" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:21</itunes:duration>
