  <item>
    <title>32 - 2024年底收获裁员大礼包 全公司心态第一好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6778ba721e823e72d319790d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6778ba721e823e72d319790d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Jan 2025 04:47:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家新年好！2025年伊始我们和大家来聊点劲爆的话题—裁员，74同学在2024年经历了人生的第一次“过年前”被裁员。惊不惊喜，意不意外？这期我们就来聊聊在澳洲被裁员的经历和心路历程，希望对大家有点裁员启蒙的作用，当然也希望大家都能不经历，还是别经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>既然这期提到了裁员，那我们也很负责的给大家提供一下澳加两国的裁员相关资料。被裁员了应该多久被公司告知？公司应该给与多少赔偿？大家可以根据自己的不同雇佣类型和工作年限来自我查询一下。算算自己万一（呸呸呸）被裁员了，能得到什么样的法定补偿，做到心中有数。</span></p><span></span><p><span>裁员这一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">00:20:30</a> 确认被裁员 靴子落地时的心情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">00:22:30</a> 赔偿 / </span><strong><span>澳洲</span></strong><span>裁员的相关规定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">00:29:40</a> 自我质疑/心情起伏/带来的改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">00:43:00</a> last day 到现在一个月干了啥 / 改简历改的崩溃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3255">00:54:15</a> 在厨师比赛综艺里看职场</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>阅读材料：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.fairwork.gov.au/tools-and-resources/fact-sheets/minimum-workplace-entitlements/notice-of-termination-and-redundancy-pay" data-url="https://www.fairwork.gov.au/tools-and-resources/fact-sheets/minimum-workplace-entitlements/notice-of-termination-and-redundancy-pay"><span>澳洲裁员的相关规定</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/services/jobs/workplace/federal-labour-standards/termination.html" data-url="https://www.canada.ca/en/services/jobs/workplace/federal-labour-standards/termination.html"><span>加拿大裁员的相关规定</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的：</span></strong></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://www.deloitte.com/global/en/issues/work/content/women-at-work-global-outlook.html" data-url="https://www.deloitte.com/global/en/issues/work/content/women-at-work-global-outlook.html"><span>Women @ Work 2024: A Global Outlook</span></a></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36598424/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36598424/"><span>黑白厨师：料理阶级战争</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrKZ5ipFw-HoL6VPTrpqa56_6JMB.m4a" length="69656933" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpq_jPHKop5bICSWsOCLGyxI5vxa.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>32</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>31 - 音乐, 演出, 和友情 | 皇家国际贵夫人 #1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674a4cce0ed328720a5912a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674a4cce0ed328720a5912a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Nov 2024 00:15:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这次和“皇家国际贵夫人”的部分成员来聊聊我们热爱的音乐, 和看演出那些事。 探索我们小十年前在北京的共同回忆。本期节目74休假，很快回归！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>豪华嘉宾阵容</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Suzy：成都人，传播舞蹈文化近十年，胡闹且记忆力惊人</span><a href="https://b23.tv/QvSmyWK" data-url="https://b23.tv/QvSmyWK"><span>【SuzyLover小熊擒狼的个人空间-哔哩哔哩】</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>网红李：就不多介绍了，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672811c633c798676f2c4d60" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672811c633c798676f2c4d60"><span>《有空可聊》常驻嘉宾网红李</span></a><span>再次袭来</span></p><span></span><p><span>秦哈哈：重庆丰都人，从事广告营销行业，不怕鬼，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/629c8d615592c955700e7f87"><span>《Orpheus微见》主播</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">00:03:00</a> 宝剑/Suzy 友情的开始：”你也喜欢摇滚乐啊” “昂”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">00:11:05</a> 网红李斥巨资在荷兰看痛仰献哈达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">00:14:05</a> 宝剑在多伦多看万青 地板不够粘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">00:15:36</a> Suzy现在对音乐的理解跟十年前的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">00:18:45</a> 秦哈哈受丰都鬼城启发的鬼文化金属专辑计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">00:30:40</a> 网红李在罗汉寺的恐怖故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a>::10 Suzy在摇滚演出中的得到短暂安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2358">00:39:18</a> 网红李目睹Armin坠台事故</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2622">00:43:42</a> 爵士怎么看 也能甩头能起哄吗 | 看演出随机碰+无计划的美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2975">00:49:35</a> 还有什么特别想看的演出吗</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我难过 </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=398522" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=398522"><span>music.163.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>痛苦的信仰 </span><a href="https://m.douban.com/subject/35848238" data-url="https://m.douban.com/subject/35848238"><span>m.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>万能青年旅店</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/35848240/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/35848240/"><span>www.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>重塑雕像的权力 </span><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/35848286/?subtype=person" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/35848286/?subtype=person"><span>www.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>AV 大久保 </span><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/35841762/?subtype=person" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/35841762/?subtype=person"><span>www.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>The Rabbit Catcher </span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/artist?id=12924382" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/artist?id=12924382"><span>music.163.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>椒麻堂会 </span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/27305997/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/27305997/"><span>movie.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Armin van Buuren b</span><a href="https://music.douban.com/musician/100278/albums?start=240&amp;format=pic&amp;sortby=vote" data-url="https://music.douban.com/musician/100278/albums?start=240&amp;format=pic&amp;sortby=vote"><span>music.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Blondie </span><a href="https://m.douban.com/subject/35842444" data-url="https://m.douban.com/subject/35842444"><span>m.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>JAMC </span><a href="https://m.douban.com/subject/35847942" data-url="https://m.douban.com/subject/35847942"><span>m.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>The Smashing Pumpkins &nbsp;</span><a href="https://m.douban.com/doulist/45753830/" data-url="https://m.douban.com/doulist/45753830/"><span>m.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>My Bloody Valentine </span><a href="https://m.douban.com/doulist/160074022/" data-url="https://m.douban.com/doulist/160074022/"><span>m.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Yīn Yīn </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/yinyinband/?hl=en" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/yinyinband/?hl=en"><span>www.instagram.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Yndi Halda </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/yndihalda/?hl=en" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/yndihalda/?hl=en"><span>www.instagram.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
