  <item>
    <title>27 - 老留子们的搬家历险记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671ec9f444ae79002c7be386</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671ec9f444ae79002c7be386</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Oct 2024 23:17:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>搬家大王74今年完成了她在澳洲的第9次搬家，于是我们就想来聊聊这些年来在国外的各种租房体验。希望可以唤起各位留子们的记忆，也希望可以对即将开启留子生活的大家有一些帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">00:01:50</a> 为什么留子们老得搬家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">00:05:44</a> 74租过最便宜的房子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">00:14:34</a> 无法交流的奇葩室友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">00:20:48</a> 租房的优点：帮助断舍离，制造新鲜感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">00:33:18</a> 二手家具可真香</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">00:39:23</a> 不租房的小烦恼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2593">00:43:13</a> 74对象把车忘在健身房两天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2850">00:47:30</a> 高敏感人群真的无法跟人合租吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">00:56:30</a> 你是哪一种：付出者、互利者和获取者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3610">01:00:10</a> 非得买房吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>无奖竞猜：74下次搬家是什么时候？</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的：</span></p><span></span><p><span>付出者、互利者和获取者的感念来自：Give and Take </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26309534/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26309534/"><strong><span>沃顿商学院最受欢迎的成功课</span></strong></a></p>]]></description>
