  <item>
    <title>26 - 西安之旅：给肉夹馍开光</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6712f7e4db2cf8275748c2da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6712f7e4db2cf8275748c2da</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 19 Oct 2024 00:05:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>两位主播终心心念念的西安之旅终于实现了！这一趟干了不少事，给肉夹馍开光，凉皮配汉堡，骑车勇闯回民街，当了兵马俑特种兵…欢迎大家和我们分享你的西安体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">00:02:45</a> 时隔快20年的卧铺体验 74突破自我跟陌生人搭话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">00:10:55</a> 吃的top3</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>刘信牛羊肉小炒泡馍</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>咸得饭庄 鱼香茄子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>银泰袁家村</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>魏记凉皮</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">00:13:30</a> 第一印象：和北京有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">00:16:00</a> 古装大唐不夜城、还想再去吗？为什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">00:20:45</a> 长恨歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">00:23:15</a> 74最爱 - 陕西历史博物馆 ，放飞自我的魏晋南北朝陶俑和唐三彩小人，显摆肌肉的胡人们和打马球的女生们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">00:25:10</a> 秦始皇铜车马 、 兵马俑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">00:30:05</a> 我们两人旅行的契合度怎么样；打车那些事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">00:40:00</a> 西安jelly cat - 肉夹馍玩偶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">00:44:15</a> 74新学会的聊天技巧 / 飞机登机小猫腻 / Nuit blanche插队的故事</span></p>]]></description>
