    <guid isPermaLink="false">670336a26c7f8177862b3f88</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Oct 2024 01:17:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>两位主播终于9月在北京碰头了！聊聊这次的回国见闻，我们又闹出了哪些洋相。感谢我们的铁粉—公主拱猪献唱片尾曲，另外结尾有彩蛋哦。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 宝剑费劲吧啦的回京</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 这次回国感觉跟以前不太一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="642">00:10:42</a> 新的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">00:15:00</a> 74在回国之旅从朋友身上 获得的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">00:20:36</a> 74忧伤的离别 宝剑丧丧的前半程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">00:27:09</a> 新体验 - 香巴拉走到模式口累翻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">00:34:15</a> 新体验 - 搓澡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2296">00:38:16</a> 炭灰肉肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2619">00:43:39</a> 宝剑妈的腰伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2833">00:47:13</a> 74见家人不够</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3264">00:54:24</a> 共享单车骑不够</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3530">00:58:50</a> 快递乌龙；医院门口的女孩儿</span></p>]]></description>
