  <item>
    <title>24 - 那些年我们与客服/机构周旋被暴击的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ef75466920a36bfcb89719</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ef75466920a36bfcb89719</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Sep 2024 01:39:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新财年伊始，宝剑突然发现自己的某个账户一直在偷偷扣钱，2年多来造成了不小损失，于是开始了自己的维权之路。这一下也勾起了我们生活中各种因为嫌麻烦，就一直拖着该干却没干的事儿。大家有什么和客服、客服/机构周旋的诀窍，欢迎与我们分享，给我们这两个怂货支支招。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">00:01:10</a> 宝剑两年半前犯得懒如何造成了今天的财务损失</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">00:14:55</a> 和客服/机构周旋被暴击到要找心理咨询师排解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">00:17:45</a> 如何一把鼻涕一把泪解决问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">00:24:25</a> 为什么如此痛恨官僚主义，是遗传吗？宝剑大学第一天的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">00:33:55</a> 怎么和客服交流是个学问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">00:36:00</a> 74 一件四年没解决的退款问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2585">00:43:05</a> 吐槽伴侣在金钱上的迷惑行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3274">00:54:34</a> 《下一个素熙 》</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e7cc741418a84a046b0c2bd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e7cc741418a84a046b0c2bd"><span>随机波动</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hans/%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%B4%A0%E7%86%99" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-hans/%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%B4%A0%E7%86%99"><span>下一个素熙</span></a><span>： </span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35739931/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35739931/"><span>movie.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>大卫·</span><em><span>格雷伯</span></em><span> The utopia of rules </span><a href="https://booklist.pixnet.net/blog/post/5482693-%E3%80%90%E6%9A%A2%E9%8A%B7%E6%9B%B8%E3%80%91%E8%A6%8F%E5%89%87%E7%9A%84%E7%83%8F%E6%89%98%E9%82%A6%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%98%E5%83%9A%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B8%E8%88%87" data-url="https://booklist.pixnet.net/blog/post/5482693-%E3%80%90%E6%9A%A2%E9%8A%B7%E6%9B%B8%E3%80%91%E8%A6%8F%E5%89%87%E7%9A%84%E7%83%8F%E6%89%98%E9%82%A6%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%98%E5%83%9A%E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6%E7%9A%84%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B8%E8%88%87"><span>規則的烏托邦</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>大卫·</span><em><span>格雷伯</span></em><span> </span><a href="https://www.marxists.org/chinese/david-graeber/2011/index.htm" data-url="https://www.marxists.org/chinese/david-graeber/2011/index.htm"><span>第一个五千年</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>大卫·</span><em><span>格雷伯</span></em><span> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929434/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35929434/"><span>Bullshit Job 狗屁工作</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>非常律师禹英禑：</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35524446/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35524446/"><span>movie.douban.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
